{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whispers of Lust</strong> is a visual novel that will immerse you in a world of dark magic, forbidden desires, and dangerous temptations. \ud83d\udc8b<br>You are Rosalind, a young student at a prestigious magic academy, struggling to master your abilities. \ud83d\udd2e But one day, everything changes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503570/extras/46c8db26ef5121a05fb9fa448f926074.poster.avif?t=1760411897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503570/extras/46c8db26ef5121a05fb9fa448f926074.webm?t=1760411897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503570/extras/78d2872bf71a79e64b0538ecbb15d196.avif?t=1760411897\" width=787 height=173 /></span>A mysterious voice haunts you, promising unimaginable power. \ud83d\udcab <i>&quot;Trust me, and I will make you powerful...&quot;</i> it whispers. But every promise comes with a price...<br>Trapped by the Demoness of Lust and Depravity, you lose control of your body and mind. \ud83d\ude08\ud83d\udd25 Now, she uses you to spread chaos throughout the academy, corrupting students, teachers, and even the monsters lurking in the dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503570/extras/dbe2ebad239cdf44b1f79f62dd3229a8.avif?t=1760411897\" width=787 height=173 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Secrets:</strong> Magic, demons, and perilous rituals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forbidden Pleasures:</strong> Scenes of passion, depravity, and violence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monsters &amp; Dungeons:</strong> Encounters with creatures that will awaken fear... and something more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503570/extras/5d5ac8eb114a0667683c240f6b2b357c.avif?t=1760411897\" width=787 height=173 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rosalind:</strong> The protagonist, whose life turns into a nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Demoness of Lust:</strong> Cunning and seductive, she knows how to awaken your darkest desires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Students and Teachers of the Academy:</strong> Each of them will become a victim... or an accomplice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Monsters:</strong> They crave more than just your life...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503570/extras/90db5b0da132694c80ed8c377c18216e.avif?t=1760411897\" width=787 height=173 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>linear story</strong> with gripping twists. \ud83d\udcd6</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized <strong>anime artwork</strong>. \ud83c\udfa8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive <strong>music &amp; sound design</strong>. \ud83c\udfb6</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animated adult scenes</strong> that will leave you breathless. \ud83d\ude0f\ud83d\udca6</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" au